# `eurozig init`

![](/founding-meeting.webp "Attendees seated around a long table in a conference room, facing a projector screen.")

Thanks to the 33 Zigguanas who became our founding members on 13 September in Munich.
You elected David (chair), Jan (deputy chair) and Julian (treasurer) to the board, and Anthon as treasurer auditor.
The bylaws, membership fee regulations, and remuneration regulations were all adopted and are available on the [website](http://localhost:1990/club/#documents).

Next steps: we are working with a notary in Nuremberg to file our registration, and hope to be a registered association (EuroZig e.V.) sometime next month.
Our application for charitable status is with the tax office.

Your new EuroZig Board

David, Jan and Julian
